          "nationality": "México",
          "bio": "Cada Día de Muertos llega a la cancha entre cempasúchil y papel picado. Con azúcar en la cabeza y alegría en el corazón, reparte pases que celebran los recuerdos de su familia."
        },
        "en": {
          "title": "The Ofrenda Playmaker",
          "role": "Marigold playmaker",
          "trait": "Bright-hearted",
          "nationality": "Mexico",
          "bio": "Every Day of the Dead, he reaches the pitch among marigolds and papel picado. With sugar on his crown and joy in his heart, he delivers passes that celebrate his family's memories."
        }
      },
